In collaboration with Prototipalo and Huspy. Huspy approached me to create a new way to experience remote real-estate for overseas buyers.

"The Egg" is a simulator that uses VR video which tracks the user so as they move around the video moves. There are certain time stamps in the video which if the user sees activates various sensations like odour (in kitchen and toilets), vibrations (when the user goes near the active washing machine), and light when the curtains are raised.

The whole project was delivered in less than 3 weeks for a marketing event in Madrid and received wide-spread press coverage.
